      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start and definitely hits the right notes, but I think it might be a bit too \"polite\" for what the board is looking for. They want to feel the weight of the situation a bit more.\n\nCould we try another version that really leans into that sense of urgency? I'm not saying make it crazy, but I really want to see that \"intensity\" score move up a bit. Try to weave those urgency words in more frequently so the gravity of the decline really hits home for the reader. \n\nJust remember—don't lose the scientific credibility, I just need it to feel more pressing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
